# A khor store is never part of this repo. It lands here only by
# accident — `KHOR_HOME=` with an empty value makes the node treat the
# working directory as its home and mint a fresh identity in it, which
# is how `.khor/identity.key` reached a commit on 2026-09-13. A private
# key is not a thing to rely on noticing.
.khor/
